{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Oracle correction during RED: Git 2.55 rejects the planned fixture command 'git repack -a -d --prune=now' because repack has no --prune option. The real-Git fixture uses the equivalent valid deterministic sequence 'git repack -a -d' then 'git prune --expire=now'. No production behavior or acceptance threshold changed."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785614674222898001,"uuid":"986a3378-4828-4f37-8851-18f9e710b94b"}